                Mailing to the categories list, Dec. 22, 1f999. (
                %a{:href => "http://www.mta.ca/~cat-dist/catlist/1999/realcoalg"}> link
                )
            %li#PP
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dusko+Pavlovic"}> Dusko Pavlovic
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vaughan+Pratt"} Vaughan Pratt
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On coalgebra of real numbers
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/viewdoc/summary?doi=10.1.1.47.5204"} web
          %p Cross-relations between algebraic and coalgebraic aspects of real numbers may be found in this article:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Freyd"}> Peter Freyd
              ,
              %em Algebraic Real Analysis, Theor.
              Appl. Cat., vol. 20, no. 10 (2008), 215-308. (
              %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/20/10/20-10abs.html"}> link
              )
          %p
            For
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+theory"} category theoretic
            treatments of the self-similarity found in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fractals"} fractals
            in terms of terminal coalgebras, see
          %ul
